{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y的叙事解释有所压缩，尤其S07少了对当初离开选择的反问，S13也弱化了不愿为了留住谁而吞下委屈这一最终立场，X在人物心理因果和结尾态度上更完整。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"作为边听边扫的普通观众，Y用短句和重点加亮让我更快抓住每段在讲什么，感受又能随音乐到时出现，不必一开始就面对整屏的情绪词，音乐变化也因此更容易被注意到。X的优势是人物为什么犹豫、为什么反复、最后为什么决定继续生活，交代得更完整，前后心理转折也更有解释力。综合来看，我选Y，因为它在实际观看时更容易兼顾阅读、听音乐和感受细节，但它确实牺牲了一部分叙事深度。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "64dd3b53-fc54-4684-8448-a3780286c70f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T153431649528Z", "elapsed_seconds": 32.391, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T15:35:04.037095+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "31c9bf9ae2a09e37c074633ddd93c3311affe76a76462f64a24792ac7eb42867", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tool